## Development

In an activated environment (venv or conda):

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pre-commit install
pytest
```

With uv: `uv sync --extra dev`, then `uv run pre-commit install` and `uv run pytest`.

Add dependencies under `dependencies` in `pyproject.toml`. The `uv-lock` pre-commit hook updates `uv.lock`; commit it with the change.

